	(text "Two 12 V inputs, and they never meet on this board: two inputs, two diodes (D-273).\nA net tie joining +12V_LOGIC to +12V_BL is not a drawing error to tidy up later - it is the\nerror the two-diode design exists to prevent." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.1600 20.3200 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "621138a0-c82c-462d-bb05-b63a952c7154")
	)
